  m_text: " Cannon Circle\nIn Cannon Circle, players are dropped onto a small island
    surrounded by deadly rotating cannons.\n Cannons will randomly target players
    and fire explosive cannonballs \u2014 a single hit is fatal.\n The arena is constantly
    shrinking in safety as cannon fire intensifies.\nStay mobile, dodge precisely,
    and try not to fall off the island.\n The last player standing wins the round!\nTip:
    The cannons track players but are not perfectly accurate. Use the terrain and
    timing to your advantage!"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
